<template><div><WorkspaceHero eyebrow="EVIDENCE & FEEDBACK" title="材料审核工作台" description="使用内置示例证书体验材料核对与审批。所有操作仅影响当前浏览器中的示例记录。"/><section class="card demo-review-list"><el-select v-model="selectedId" aria-label="选择演示申报" @change="reload"><el-option v-for="a in applications" :key="a.id" :value="a.id" :label="a.title"/></el-select><el-tag>{{statusText[current?.status]||current?.status}}</el-tag><el-button @click="reload">刷新记录</el-button></section><template v-if="current"><MaterialReviewWorkspace :app="current"/><section class="card demo-decision"><h2>给出审核意见</h2><el-form label-position="top"><el-form-item label="认定分数"><el-input-number v-model="score" :min="0" :max="Number(current.applyScore)" :step="0.5"/></el-form-item><el-form-item label="审核说明"><el-input v-model="comment" type="textarea" :rows="3" maxlength="500" placeholder="说明核对结果，或学生需要补充的内容"/></el-form-item></el-form><div class="reason-options"><el-button v-for="reason in returnReasons" :key="reason.label" size="small" plain @click="comment=appendReviewReason(comment,reason.text)||comment">{{reason.label}}</el-button></div><div class="decision-actions"><el-button type="warning" @click="review('return')">退回补充</el-button><el-button type="danger" plain @click="review('reject')">驳回申报</el-button><el-button type="primary" @click="review('approve')">确认通过（演示）</el-button></div></section></template></div></template>
<script setup>
import {ref,computed} from 'vue';import {ElMessage} from 'element-plus';import {useUserStore} from '@/stores/user';import WorkspaceHero from '@/components/WorkspaceHero.vue';import MaterialReviewWorkspace from '@/components/MaterialReviewWorkspace.vue';import {returnReasons,appendReviewReason} from '@/utils/reviewWorkspace';import {currentState} from './data.js';import {getApplicationDetail,reviewApplication,finalReviewApplication} from '@/api/applications';
const user=useUserStore();const applications=ref(currentState().applications.filter(a=>a.status!=='draft'));const selectedId=ref(applications.value.find(a=>a.status==='pending')?.id||1);const current=ref(applications.value.find(a=>a.id===selectedId.value));const score=ref(Number(current.value?.applyScore||0));const comment=ref('');const statusText={pending:'待审核',returned:'待补充',approved:'已通过',rejected:'已驳回'};
async function reload(){current.value=await getApplicationDetail(selectedId.value);score.value=Number(current.value.applyScore);comment.value='';}
async function review(action){if(action!=='approve'&&comment.value.trim().length<2)return ElMessage.warning('请先填写需要补充的内容或驳回理由');const api=user.role==='counselor'&&current.value.status==='approved'?finalReviewApplication:reviewApplication;await api(current.value.id,{action,finalScore:score.value,comment:comment.value});await reload();ElMessage.success('演示审核结果已保存，可切换学生身份查看。');}
</script>
<style scoped>.demo-review-list{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:20px;margin-top:20px;}.demo-review-list .el-select{width:360px;max-width:100%;}.demo-decision{padding:24px;margin:20px;}.demo-decision h2{font-size:17px;margin-bottom:20px;}.reason-options{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;}.reason-options .el-button{margin:0;}.decision-actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:24px;}.decision-actions .el-button{margin:0;}@media(max-width:600px){.demo-decision{margin:16px 0;padding:18px;}:deep(.material-desk){margin:16px 0;}}</style>
